<title>USA: TCC says shareholder slate has most votes.</title>
<headline>TCC says shareholder slate has most votes.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>TCC Industries Inc said on Wednesday that Walter DeRoeck and Robert Thomajan, nominees of the shareholders committee, received the most votes for election to the company's board of directors during voting at its annual meeting on May 7.</p>
<p>The company said the final results will be announced on May 23, when the annual meeting is reconvened.</p>
<p>The operating companies of TCC Industries Inc design and manufacture bulk material conveying and processing systems.</p>
